    "imageUrl": "https://imagens.ebc.com.br/jbQaSeMSyFqHt1BTUG4ko3k1VGY=/1170x700/smart/https://agenciabrasil.ebc.com.br/sites/default/files/thumbnails/image/2026/04/09/780fa474-5854-41f4-9502-dc65d01e640a.jpeg?itok=IkBAd34q",
    "imageCaption": "PF faz operação no Rio para conter repasses ilegais de arma a CACs",
